---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Live Real Estate Chat Hub | Joe Sheldon"
description: "Connect directly with Redfin Senior Agent Joe Sheldon via real-time live chat."
permalink: /chat/index.html
aliases:
  - /livechat/index.html
---

<main class="layout-container layout-stack-main">

    {# Section 1.0 & 2.0: Page Header #}
    <header class="surface-bento page-hero-bento">
        <h1 class="text-page-title">Let's Talk Real Estate</h1>
        <p class="text-body page-hero-lead">
            Start your chat below to connect directly with Joe.
        </p>
    </header>

    <div class="section-divider"></div>

    {# Section 3.0: Live Chat Widget Desk #}
    <section id="chat-desk" class="content-section-centered">
        {% include "components/widget/livechat.njk" %}
    </section>

    <div class="section-divider"></div>

    {# Section 4.0: Quick Tools & Resources / Privacy Note #}
    <section id="chat-resources" class="content-section-centered">
        <div class="section-grid-static grid-cols-2">
            
            {# Pos 1: Quick Tools & Resources #}
            <article class="surface-bento callout-feature-card">
                <h2 class="text-section-title callout-cta-title">Quick Tools & Resources</h2>
                <p class="text-body-secondary callout-feature-desc">
                    Take a look at some calculators and resources while you chat:
                </p>
                <div class="livechat-actions-stack action-tray-constrained">
                    <a href="/calculators/" class="btn btn-primary">Real Estate Calculators</a>
                    <a href="/resources/" class="btn btn-primary">Additional Resources</a>
                </div>
            </article>

            {# Pos 2: Privacy Note #}
            <article class="surface-bento callout-feature-card">
                <h2 class="text-section-title callout-cta-title">Privacy Note</h2>
                <p class="text-body-secondary callout-feature-desc">
                    This website does not track visitors' info. However, our chat provider does need to track a few things to organize the chats, so this page includes the required tracking.
                </p>
            </article>

        </div>
    </section>

</main>